  src/x86_64/gp_table.zig   x86-64 general-purpose instruction encodings, generated by
                            tools/gen_tables.zig from llvm/lib/Target/X86/*.td
                            (via `llvm-tblgen --dump-json`).
  src/x86_64/vec_table.zig  x86-64 SSE/AVX/AVX-512/AVX10/MMX/x87/AMX/system instruction
                            encodings, generated the same way (tools/gen_x86_vec.zig).

The generator (tools/) is pyrlyn-jit code. LLVM itself is not part of the build or of the
distributed library; the generated tables are committed.
